    {
      "id": "e001022",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 350.8095266439842,
      "y": 747.6,
      "width": 274.962890625,
      "height": 120,
      "text": "• follower 落后到快照点之前触发\n• 单阶段 pending_snapshot_ 挂起，快照应用串行化\n  由 ApplyLoop 锁外 push(坑G)\n• 阶段2 推进 last_applied_\n• CondInstallSnapshot 守卫\n• 快照blob 持久化移至锁外避免大快照落盘占锁时间\n  过长\n• voter, learner可接收",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• follower 落后到快照点之前触发\n• 单阶段 pending_snapshot_ 挂起，快照应用串行化\n  由 ApplyLoop 锁外 push(坑G)\n• 阶段2 推进 last_applied_\n• CondInstallSnapshot 守卫\n• 快照blob 持久化移至锁外避免大快照落盘占锁时间\n  过长\n• voter, learner可接收",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12,
