      "y": 759.4643728898122,
      "width": 194.994140625,
      "height": 105,
      "text": "• SaveStateAndSnapshot(state,blob)\n• SaveSnapshotOnly(blob) 两阶段\n• RaftStateSize() 阈值门控\n• ReadSnapshot() 重启恢复\n• PersistLocked() 持久化状态\n• ReadPersist(). 恢复快照+状态\n",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• SaveStateAndSnapshot(state,blob)\n• SaveSnapshotOnly(blob) 两阶段\n• RaftStateSize() 阈值门控\n• ReadSnapshot() 重启恢复\n• PersistLocked() 持久化状态\n• ReadPersist(). 恢复快照+状态\n",
